    "name": "Elder Vampire",
    "description": "You have outlived empires, witnessed kingdoms disappear, and watched humanity repeat the same mistakes under different flags.  You learned long ago that strength alone is not enough: the superior predator prepares before the hunt.  Over centuries, you cultivated contacts among soldiers, physicians, smugglers, and people who never asked why their benefactor never seemed to age.  Your modern equipment is the result of careful preparation, acquired favors, and the occasional disappearance of someone who made the mistake of standing in your way.\n\nThe Cataclysm has changed the rules of the world.  It has not changed yours.  The streets are crowded with the dead, the living are desperate, and the night belongs to those who know how to use it.  You are not searching for the secret of immortality.  You are looking for your next challenge.",
